<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Testing examples</title><style>body{font:16px Arial;max-width:800px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 16px}section{border:1px solid #bbb;padding:15px;margin:15px 0}a{color:#075b9a}</style></head><body><p><a href="{{ route('catalogue.index') }}">← Back to catalogue</a></p><h1>Examples for testing</h1><p>These are illustrative entries only; they are not loaded into the internal catalogue.</p><section><h2>Event services company</h2><p><strong>Client statement:</strong> “We cannot answer every request for proposal. Checking people, equipment, transport and catering availability takes too long.”</p><p><strong>Problem:</strong> Resource and project management are lacking.</p><p><strong>Possible approaches:</strong> Enterprise resource planning, project planning tool, or a well-designed spreadsheet.</p><p><strong>KPI:</strong> Sales growth or number of requests answered.</p></section><section><h2>Low awareness</h2><p><strong>Client statement:</strong> “No one knows about us.”</p><p><strong>Problem:</strong> Brand awareness is weak.</p><p><strong>Possible approaches:</strong> Marketing campaign, social media presence, brand redesign or website.</p><p><strong>Useful tags:</strong> B2B, international, scalable.</p></section></body></html>
